{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":24.72},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.24,"end":47.2},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":48.68,"end":59.44}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":3.44,"text":"產生器應用可能暴露錯誤的資料來檢查。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.64,"end":10.8,"text":"最終版本含兩件作品、安全文字轉換與內嵌響應式版面。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":11.68,"end":15.76,"text":"加入跳脫標題的斷言、檢查實際頁面，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.84,"end":17.6,"text":"再下載產生的 ZIP。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":18.56,"end":20.4,"text":"這些檔案是靜態輸出；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":20.96,"end":24.72,"text":"Flask 或 Django 服務是不同的部署模型。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.24,"end":27.36,"text":"把 /chapter5."},{"sectionId":"build","start":27.547,"end":30.88,"text":"py 的驗證註解改成 assert \"&lt;"},{"sectionId":"build","start":30.88,"end":31.44,"text":"draft&gt;"},{"sectionId":"build","start":31.72,"end":32,"text":"\" in page。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":32.64,"end":34.96,"text":"成功執行後檢查兩件作品，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":35.24,"end":37.92,"text":"並用下載 ZIP 保留 index."},{"sectionId":"build","start":38.096,"end":38.8,"text":"html。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":39.44,"end":40.96,"text":"也保留 Python 原始碼，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":41.12,"end":42.88,"text":"方便日後重新產生。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":44.52,"end":46.08,"text":"為了日後更新資料，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":46.16,"end":47.2,"text":"應保留什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":48.68,"end":50.32,"text":"為了日後更新資料，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":50.48,"end":51.68,"text":"應保留什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":52.719,"end":56.32,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":56.96,"end":59.44,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}